# Keeps the Docker build context (repo root, per backend/Dockerfile and
# frontend/Dockerfile) small — node_modules/build output get reinstalled/
# rebuilt inside the image anyway, and none of this needs to be uploaded to
# the Docker daemon.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.storybook-static
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
